{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88fd6006945d2809a41","chatId":"bbdef1e90d5b493d97a7a636f76f6802","sessionId":null,"userId":67821,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"F\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"B\"\n}","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1001,"promptTokens":1560,"completionTokens":20,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:19"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574254443941196,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88fd6006945d2809a40","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369679602,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e88fd6006945d2809a40","chatId":"bbdef1e90d5b493d97a7a636f76f6802","sessionId":null,"userId":67821,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n小妮与小汤在一起十年多了，她把小汤视作灵魂伴侣并打算和他结婚。然而，她并不知道的是，小汤已经出轨两年了，打算与她分手并与另一个女人在一起。他对此很确信，也认为自己对小妮完全没有感情了。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，小妮最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 钦佩 & 尴尬\nB) 没意识的 & 钦佩\nC) 开心 & 爱护\nD) 愧疚 & 没意识的\nE) 开心 & 钦佩\nF) 开心 & 没意识的\n\n## 问题 2\n小妮为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她无法相信小汤背叛了她\nB) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她不知道小汤出轨了\nC) 她不知道小汤出轨了 & 她不知道小汤是她的灵魂伴侣\nD) 她的朋友们支持她和小汤的关系 & 她无法相信小汤背叛了她\nE) 她觉得自己找到了灵魂伴侣 & 她用另一个男人背叛了小汤\nF) 她无法相信小汤背叛了她 & 她不知道小汤是她的灵魂伴侣","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.008574254443941196,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e88fd6006945d2809a41","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369679599,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:01:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"32b5da9a083c4aceb1783e8f04eacd60"}